  "voice": {
    "script": "This puck is louder | than your TV. | It looks like a coaster. | It's a speaker, | about the size of a cookie. | Three parts. | A driver on top | fires sound down into a cone, | which spreads it out | in every direction. | The battery underneath | runs twelve hours. | Your phone sends the music | over Bluetooth, | and the puck does the rest. | Watch. [pause 3.5] Does it work | with your phone? | Any phone with Bluetooth. | How heavy? | A hundred and eighty grams. | And the price? | Ninety-nine dollars. | So, would you put one | on your desk?",
    "words": null,
    "vo": null,
    "wps": 3.2
  },
  "music": null,
  "sfxVolume": 0.8,
  "tail": 3.4,
